# UI verification

Check a page with the `agent-browser` CLI.

```bash
agent-browser close
agent-browser open "http://localhost:6006/?path=/story/example--story&full=true"
agent-browser wait --load networkidle
agent-browser screenshot --full name.png
```

Storybook links include `&full=true`.
